{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ae0b4d64-7b20-8486-8d3f-eb6a033161bf",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T10:09:56-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Joao Vieira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:07:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:07:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good morning. My name's Joao Vieira. I'm calling about a storm drain, um, it's gurgling, you know, and there's this sewer smell coming up out of it. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:07:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, gurgling and a sewer smell. Is that the drain out in the street, or one on your property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:07:40-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's in the street, right at the curb in front of my house. I mean, it's been like that since last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. You know, the water's mostly gone, but the drain's still making noise and it stinks. Are you following me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:07:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm with you. So it started after the storm and it's still going today. Is there standing water around it, or is it just the sound and the smell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:08:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the sound and the smell right now. A little bit of puddle, I mean, nothing crazy. But with the smell, I figured something's backed up down there. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:08:18-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be a blockage or debris from the storm. I'll put in a request for a crew to check it. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:08:27-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, um, you know what, I'm gonna say it's the one on my street, and I don't, uh, wait. Sorry. I'm bad at phone calls. Always have been. Can I just give you my number, and you can call me for the location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:08:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're doing fine. But I do need the location to send anyone out. Can you give me the street and number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:08:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. Okay. I actually have photos of it too. I took a few yesterday. I can send those if that helps, you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:08:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Photos are great. I'll note that you have them. I can give you an email for sending them once we've got the request started, or the crew can ask when they call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:09:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that works. So you have my number? It's 401-555-0190."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:09:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0190, got it. And that's Joao Vieira, J-O-A-O?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:09:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, J-O-A-O, Vieira, V-I-E-I-R-A. Right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:09:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. I've got the request noted as a gurgling drain with sewer odor after the storm. Crews are busy this week with storm cleanup, so it may take a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:09:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, no, I understand, I mean, after a storm like that. Could somebody call me back when it's done? Just so I know it got taken care of."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:09:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll ask that you get a call back once the work is finished."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:09:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thanks a lot. Sorry again about the phone thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:09:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're all set, Mr. Vieira. Take care."
    }
  ],
